  "intro": {
    "language": "en",
    "text": "Lee Hae-jin (Korean: 이해진; born 22 June 1967) is a South Korean businessman known for founding Naver Corporation. He is among the richest people in South Korea; in December 2024, Forbes estimated his net worth at US$1.3 billion and ranked him 25th richest in the country.\n\n",
